  "Prevents a later save from silently clobbering an earlier one when the same post is edited across tabs or devices. The editor sends the version it loaded as baseVersion, and the server only UPDATEs while version is unchanged. Zero rows means someone saved in between, so it answers 409 version_conflict and the editor asks the user to overwrite, reload, or cancel.",
