  "Simultaneous edits are rare. Locking all the time to prevent a rare event means paying the cost of managing locks all the time.\n\nDetecting a conflict when it happens beats preventing it in advance. Detection needs one number and one line in the save condition. The goal was never to eliminate conflicts, only to make sure nothing is overwritten in silence.",
