  "Site settings",
  "Site settings, profile, and secrets are stored in config JSONB under id='default', 'profile', 'secrets' rows. The same way, AI provider health (ai_health), this month's usage (ai_usage), the TTS pronunciation lexicon (tts_lexicon) and the contact-attachment state (contact_attachment) each take one row — small site-wide values that don't warrant their own tables.",
