  "Six problems a one-person CMS runs into, and how this site stops each — on small screens that follow the real admin's rules: never losing a post, scheduling and cleanup on their own, guarding sign-up-free comments, keeping strangers out, refusing what a role can't do, and shipping emojis light. Each plays once on its own, and the guide star points to what to watch.",
